{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个人逐渐发现自己很喜欢另一个人，却始终害怕这份需要会成为对方的负担，也害怕对方有一天不再需要自己。他从小心翼翼地试探、反复怀疑，到慢慢敢于表达和付出，最后接受亲近未必永远，却不再藏起自己的喜欢。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"心动却不敢说\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"亲近让他慢慢放松\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"享受当下却难开口\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"想坦白又怕破坏亲近\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"露出在乎后慌了\",\n      \"echo\": \"S04\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"被如常对待仍孤单\",\n      \"echo\": \"S05\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"想成为对方的依靠\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"想回应又怕没有以后\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"怕对方不再需要他\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"选择珍惜眼前亲近\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"不再为喜欢道歉\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"不再收着，想给更多\",\n      \"echo\": \"S11\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"想要保证又怕失去\",\n      \"echo\": \"S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"caught\": \"放下保证，坦然表达\",\n      \"echo\": \"S13\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是 S06 到 S08，亲近、孤单、想被需要和想成为依靠几种情绪连续转换，容易觉得他在相似的情绪里反复打转。最抓人的是 S04 和 S13：明明很幸福，却因为害怕失去而越来越想抓紧，情绪上的矛盾很鲜明。S14 最后不再索要永远的保证，而是选择坦然表达，让这段变化有了一个落点。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d657884e-83a5-471e-85fd-599307a18c1e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T194132862456Z", "elapsed_seconds": 61.312, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T19:42:34.180756+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1c9d2f0792b00ee50f5c7ad587ce89658e8266a6695f57f90a7a2c471676af8f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T194132862456Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "00d8354d1d683536ff1d01824096b585dacd5c9c59af3d83dc64e5e16b2fca2c"}}}
